WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.810
Dashboard in the real macOS app, filled with fictional sample History

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:12.197
History keeps every dictation, searchable

00:00:12.197 --> 00:00:16.497
In another app, a double-tap of the shortcut starts dictation (sent by the test driver)

00:00:16.497 --> 00:00:19.716
Recording. This demo plays a synthetic audio clip, not a live microphone

00:00:19.716 --> 00:00:23.245
Stop with one tap. A test fixture returns fixed text instead of a speech provider

00:00:23.245 --> 00:00:28.507
Clipboard output mode: Speak copies the text, then ⌘V pastes it

00:00:28.507 --> 00:00:36.304
The new dictation is saved to History
